      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOOSEBUMPS RICO (4) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (24.10) at this track behind Perfect Ace in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Rates highly and will give a great sight. HIGH COTTON (1) turned in a solid run last start over 425m at this track finishing 4th and beaten only 4 lengths (24.24). Must be included in calculations. DANCE LADY DANCE (2) finds it hard to win but looks close to breaking through. Continues to race well, filling the minors at the last three starts, the latest when second (25.58) at Ballarat. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Can measure up. BAYINI (8) returns here with a good chance to improve on last time.",
